title: moon1_combat_mud_golem_spawn
---
Milo: *(ears flat, growling)*
Milo: Something's coming through the mud. The dissonance noticed us.
Milo: Use Resonance Pulse to stagger it — then Harmonic Strike.
===

title: moon1_combat_mud_golem_player_hit
---
Milo: Watch your footing! Frequency Shield up — hold the left trigger!
===

title: moon1_combat_mud_golem_victory
---
Milo: *(panting, then laughing)*
Milo: You retuned it. Look — it's dissolving back to purified mud.
Milo: That mud is yours now. Crafting material for later, I think.
===

title: moon1_combat_reset_scout_warning
---
Milo: *(whisper)*
Milo: That's not a golem. That's a Reset Scout.
Milo: They're smart. They study you. Don't let it walk away or it will report what you can do.
===

title: moon1_combat_reset_scout_victory
---
Milo: *(quietly)*
Milo: It dropped a fragment of itself. We'll learn from this.
Milo: But they will send more. Be ready.
===

title: moon1_rs_threshold_25_first_hit
---
Milo: Resonance Score twenty-five! That's the first threshold.
Milo: The Aether field will get clearer now. Use Aether Vision — press Y — and watch.
===

title: moon1_rs_threshold_50_growing
---
Milo: Fifty. Halfway to the zone shift.
Milo: Listen to the music — it's deeper now. The hum is layered.
===

title: moon1_rs_threshold_75_zone_shift
---
Milo: *(exhaling slowly)*
Milo: Seventy-five. *Feel that?*
Milo: The valley just exhaled for the first time in a hundred years.
Milo: This is what restoration *means*.
===
